{
  "id": "forms",
  "securityDomains": [
    "ManageTimeOff"
  ],
  "include": [
    "workerData.script"
  ],
  "endPoints": [
    {
      "name": "worker",
      "baseUrlType": "workday-staffing",
      "url": "workers/me",
      "authType": "sso"
    }
  ],
  "outboundData": {
    "outboundEndPoints": [
      {
        "name": "timeOffRequest",
        "baseUrlType": "app",
        "url": "timeOffRequests",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "authType": "sso",
        "onSend": "<% self.data.put('worker', {'id': worker.id}); self.data.put('status', 'Submitted'); self.data.put('requestId', `{{worker.id}}-{{date:getTodaysDate(date:getDateTimeZone(userTimeZone))}}-{{leaveType.value}}`); return self.data; %>"
      }
    ],
    "responseErrorDetail": {
      "errorSummary": "<% error %>",
      "errors": "<% errors.map(item => { item.error }); %>"
    }
  },
  "presentation": {
    "pageType": "EDIT",
    "title": {
      "type": "title",
      "label": "Forms and Inputs"
    },
    "body": {
      "type": "section",
      "horizontal": false,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "pod",
          "podId": "header"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "enabled": false,
          "value": "Canvas Kit wraps every input in a <code>FormField</code> that owns the label, hint and error state. Extend has no wrapper: <code>label</code> is an attribute on the widget itself, and grouping is done with <code>fieldSet</code>. Validation is declarative &mdash; <code>required</code> and <code>helpText</code> rather than a <code>touched</code> flag in component state.<br/><br/>Unlike the React demo, this form is real. Each field carries a <code>valueOutBinding</code> naming where its value lands in the outbound payload, and submitting POSTs a <code>TimeOffRequest</code> business object. The submit and cancel buttons are the platform's, not the app's."
        },
        {
          "type": "fieldSet",
          "title": "Request time off",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "requestingWorker",
              "label": "Worker",
              "enabled": false,
              "value": "<% worker.descriptor %>",
              "helpText": "Taken from workers/me. The request is stamped with this worker in onSend, so the payload cannot be spoofed from the page."
            },
            {
              "type": "dropdown",
              "id": "leaveType",
              "label": "Leave type",
              "required": true,
              "valueOutBinding": "timeOffRequest.leaveType",
              "instanceList": [
                {
                  "id": "Paid time off",
                  "descriptor": "Paid time off"
                },
                {
                  "id": "Sick leave",
                  "descriptor": "Sick leave"
                },
                {
                  "id": "Parental leave",
                  "descriptor": "Parental leave"
                },
                {
                  "id": "Unpaid leave",
                  "descriptor": "Unpaid leave"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "date",
              "id": "startDate",
              "label": "First day off",
              "required": true,
              "enabled": true,
              "valueOutBinding": "timeOffRequest.startDate",
              "value": "<% date:getTodaysDate(date:getDateTimeZone(userTimeZone)) %>"
            },
            {
              "type": "number",
              "id": "daysRequested",
              "label": "Days requested",
              "required": true,
              "enabled": true,
              "minimumValue": "1",
              "maximumValue": "30",
              "valueOutBinding": "timeOffRequest.daysRequested",
              "value": "<% 1 %>",
              "helpText": "Requests over 10 days set the requiresSecondApproval derived field on the business object."
            },
            {
              "type": "textArea",
              "id": "requestReason",
              "label": "Reason",
              "enabled": true,
              "valueOutBinding": "timeOffRequest.reason",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "checkBox",
              "id": "notifyManager",
              "label": "Notify my manager immediately",
              "valueOutBinding": "timeOffRequest.notifyManager",
              "value": "<% true %>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "fieldSet",
          "title": "Where the value goes",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "enabled": false,
              "value": "<code>valueOutBinding</code> is the piece with no Canvas Kit counterpart. In React you read state and build the request body yourself; here each widget declares its own path into the payload, and the platform assembles it. <code>onSend</code> then adds what the page must not be trusted to supply &mdash; the worker, the status and the reference id."
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "id": "bindingGrid",
              "enabled": false,
              "doNotAdd": true,
              "doNotRemoveRow": true,
              "rowVariableName": "row",
              "rows": "<% [ {'widget': 'leaveType (dropdown)', 'binding': 'timeOffRequest.leaveType'}, {'widget': 'startDate (date)', 'binding': 'timeOffRequest.startDate'}, {'widget': 'daysRequested (number)', 'binding': 'timeOffRequest.daysRequested'}, {'widget': 'requestReason (textArea)', 'binding': 'timeOffRequest.reason'}, {'widget': 'notifyManager (checkBox)', 'binding': 'timeOffRequest.notifyManager'}, {'widget': 'none, set in onSend', 'binding': 'worker, status, requestId'} ] %>",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "type": "column",
                  "columnId": "bindingWidget",
                  "label": "Widget",
                  "cellTemplate": {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "<% row.widget %>"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "column",
                  "columnId": "bindingPath",
                  "label": "valueOutBinding",
                  "cellTemplate": {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "<% row.binding %>"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "fieldSet",
          "title": "Field states",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "enabled": false,
              "value": "The React demo showed default, caution, error and disabled variants. Extend exposes <code>required</code>, <code>helpText</code> and <code>enabled</code>; there is no caution tier. These fields are unbound, so they demonstrate the states without joining the payload."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "defaultField",
              "label": "Default",
              "value": "Looks good",
              "helpText": "Helper text sits below the input.",
              "enabled": true
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "requiredField",
              "label": "Required",
              "required": true,
              "value": "",
              "helpText": "Leave this empty and submit to see the platform error treatment.",
              "enabled": true
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "disabledField",
              "label": "Disabled",
              "value": "Read only",
              "enabled": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "fieldSet",
          "title": "Choice widgets",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "radioGroup",
              "id": "teamRadio",
              "label": "Team",
              "instanceList": "<% workerData.getTeamInstances() %>"
            },
            {
              "type": "checkBoxList",
              "id": "notificationPrefs",
              "label": "Notifications",
              "instanceList": [
                {
                  "id": "email",
                  "descriptor": "Email notifications"
                },
                {
                  "id": "push",
                  "descriptor": "Push notifications"
                },
                {
                  "id": "digest",
                  "descriptor": "Weekly digest"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "currency",
              "id": "dailyRate",
              "label": "Daily rate",
              "currencyCode": "USD",
              "value": "420.00",
              "enabled": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "footer": {
      "type": "footer",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "pod",
          "podId": "footer"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
